Well, <name>, you've been an enormous asset to the expedition so far. Debaar, Buck, and I couldn't have have assembled such an amazing collection of trophies without you.

But, I hear there are even fiercer monsters in other parts of the basin. I've sent a search party up north to get an idea of what other beasts await us.

I'd like you to meet up with them and see what they've found. Head north, beyond Bittertide Lake and search for the encampment. 
